sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Uploader
    participant API as API
    participant Q as Queue
    participant W as Worker
    participant Obj as Object store
    U->>Obj: upload the original
    U->>API: register it
    API->>Q: enqueue one job per derivative
    W->>Q: pull a job
    W->>Obj: read the original
    W->>W: resize, transcode, strip metadata
    W->>Obj: write the derivative at a deterministic key
    Note over W,Obj: a deterministic key makes retries idempotent — reprocessing overwrites, never duplicates
    alt the job fails
        W->>Q: requeue with backoff
        Note over Q: after N attempts it goes to the dead-letter queue, not round the loop forever
    end
